{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 09:03:58 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Starting read_file enhancement project - two main goals: (1) Fix search mode to handle complex regex patterns properly, (2) Add AST/structure analysis to scan mode for code (functions/classes with line numbers) and markdown (headings with line numbers) | phase=investigation; priority=low; reasoning={\"how\": \"Will investigate current implementation, identify regex handling issues, design AST parsing for Python/JS/TS/etc and markdown heading extraction\", \"what\": \"Current search mode has regex issues, scan mode only returns basic file info without structural analysis\", \"why\": \"User needs advanced file introspection capabilities - regex search for precise queries and structural scanning for codebase navigation\"}; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T09:03:58.076570+00:00_be597093", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T09:03:58.076598+00:00"}
