{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 09:06:25 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Critical design requirements captured: (1) Scan mode MUST paginate to prevent explosion, (2) Scan results must include chunk IDs and metadata to inform subsequent read_file calls, (3) SKILL.md detection - need to decide: auto-load full content in scan response OR parse structure + force full read indicator? | phase=requirements; priority=low; reasoning={\"how\": \"Will design pagination with configurable page size, add chunk/section metadata to scan output, evaluate SKILL.md auto-load trade-offs (convenience vs consistency)\", \"what\": \"Need pagination strategy, metadata schema for chunk navigation, decision on SKILL.md auto-load vs parse-only behavior\", \"why\": \"Scan mode without pagination could overwhelm output; chunk IDs enable seamless navigation between scan->chunk/page modes; SKILL.md files are critical operational docs that may need special treatment\"}; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T09:06:25.534889+00:00_431c1b17", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T09:06:25.534929+00:00"}
