{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 09:07:23 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Design decision: SKILL.md special case uses Option B - scan returns structure with URGENT metadata flag: {\"requires_full_read\": true, \"urgency\": \"CRITICAL\", \"reason\": \"SKILL.md detected - READ THE SKILL IMMEDIATELY\"}. This maintains scan consistency while making skill importance unmissable. | decision=option_b_urgent_flag; phase=design; priority=medium; reasoning={\"how\": \"Scan parses structure but adds high-visibility metadata flag that demands immediate full read\", \"what\": \"Need to balance consistency (scan always returns structure) with urgency (agents MUST read skills)\", \"why\": \"SKILL.md files contain critical operational rules that agents must follow - missing them causes protocol violations\"}; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T09:07:23.162229+00:00_853f9382", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T09:07:23.162266+00:00"}
