{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 09:22:13 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: read_file_enhancement] User feedback: Emoji spam is seizure-inducing. Trim to ~10-20% - keep ONE \ud83d\udea8, remove walls of emojis. Authority comes from precision (line numbers, structure) not volume. The system design is solid, just needs civilizing. Fixing now. | feedback=user_correction; priority=low; reasoning={\"how\": \"Reduce to 1-2 emojis total, let line numbers and structure do authority work\", \"what\": \"Current banner has emoji walls that make output harder to scan\", \"why\": \"Visual noise risks agents mentally skipping actual instruction - stern warning label, not Vegas slot machine\"}; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T09:22:13.797380+00:00_63134b10", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T09:22:13.797406+00:00"}
