{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 09:23:48 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Emoji cleanup complete. SKILL.md warning now stern and authoritative: ONE \ud83d\udea8, clean separator lines, direct command 'READ THE SKILL'. Removed emoji walls (was 93 emojis, now 1). Authority comes from precision and line numbers, not visual noise. | emoji_reduction=93_to_1; files_modified=[\"utils/response.py\", \"tools/read_file.py\"]; priority=medium; reasoning={\"how\": \"Replaced 31x emoji repeats with clean separator lines, shortened reason to 'READ THE SKILL', kept one marker emoji\", \"what\": \"Changed from wall-of-emoji seizure to stern warning label with single \\ud83d\\udea8\", \"why\": \"Emoji spam makes output harder to scan and risks agents skipping instruction\"}; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T09:23:48.743933+00:00_4d3a254b", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T09:23:48.743960+00:00"}
