{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 09:41:31 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Examined read_file() function signature (lines 632-710). Current parameters: path, mode, chunk_index, start_line, end_line, page_number, page_size, search, query, search_mode, case_insensitive, context_lines, max_matches, fuzzy_threshold, format. Will add: include_dependencies (bool, default False) for opt-in dependency analysis. | confidence=0.9; discovery=function_signature; new_parameter=include_dependencies; reasoning={\"how\": \"Examined function signature to plan parameter integration\", \"what\": \"Function already has 15 parameters - adding one more for opt-in dependency analysis\", \"why\": \"Need to understand current API surface before proposing additions\"}; stage=research; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T09:41:31.384163+00:00_3e55227c", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T09:41:31.384191+00:00"}
