{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 10:36:24 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase1] [Project: read_file_enhancement] \u2705 Task 1C complete: Integrated _extract_imports() with response schema. When include_dependencies=True, scan_only mode now parses AST and calls _extract_imports(). Response includes dependencies object with imports list, total_imports count, truncated flag, and empty unresolved list (Phase 2). Error handling added - parsing failures don't break scan. | files_changed=[\"tools/read_file.py\"]; lines_added=28; reasoning={\"how\": \"Reused AST parsing pattern from _extract_python_structure(), called _extract_imports(tree), populated response[dependencies] dict matching architecture schema lines 192-210, ensured parsing failures return error object instead of breaking scan\", \"what\": \"Added conditional block that parses AST, calls _extract_imports(), builds dependencies response object with imports, total_imports, truncated, unresolved; added error handling for syntax errors\", \"why\": \"Wire import extraction into scan_only response to expose dependency data to callers\"}; task=1C; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T10:36:24.716002+00:00_fe799021", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T10:36:24.716033+00:00"}
