{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 10:37:33 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase1] [Project: read_file_enhancement] \u2705 Task 1D complete: Updated readable formatter to display dependencies. Added \ud83d\udce6 Dependencies section after structure display in utils/response.py. Shows imports with line numbers, handles relative imports (dots), formats 'import x' vs 'from x import y', displays up to 20 imports with truncation message. Clean, scannable output with ONE emoji as per design spec. | files_changed=[\"utils/response.py\"]; lines_added=56; reasoning={\"how\": \"Inserted code at line 663 after structure section, before metadata; used ONE \\ud83d\\udce6 emoji for section header; formatted import vs from_import differently; handled relative imports with dot display; respects display_limit of 20 for readability; shows truncation messages for >20 and >100 imports\", \"what\": \"Added dependencies section in format_readable_file_content() after structure block; displays imports with line numbers, module names, import types, relative import dots, names lists; limits display to 20 imports with truncation message; error handling for parse failures\", \"why\": \"Enable human-readable dependency display in read_file output for agent and user comprehension\"}; task=1D; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T10:37:33.472293+00:00_7d87b275", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T10:37:33.472322+00:00"}
