{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 10:38:26 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase1] [Project: read_file_enhancement] \u2705 Task 1E complete: Created comprehensive test suite for import extraction. 14 test cases covering all import types: basic import, import with alias, from import (single/multiple), relative imports (., .., ...), empty files, mixed types, truncation, conditional imports, import *, line numbers, multiline imports. All tests passing (14/14). | coverage=100%; files_changed=[\"tests/test_read_file_dependencies.py\"]; lines_added=265; reasoning={\"how\": \"Used pytest framework, added MCP_SPINE to path, tested each import type separately then mixed, verified schema correctness (module, type, line, names, alias, level), tested edge cases (empty, no imports, nested blocks), validated truncation behavior at 100 limit\", \"what\": \"Created test_read_file_dependencies.py with 14 test cases: basic imports, aliases, from imports, multiple names, relative imports (1-3 levels), empty files, mixed types, truncation at max_imports, conditional imports, import *, accurate line numbers, multiline imports\", \"why\": \"Ensure _extract_imports() function handles all import types correctly with comprehensive edge case coverage\"}; task=1E; tests_passed=14; tests_run=14; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T10:38:26.232084+00:00_74f84988", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T10:38:26.232114+00:00"}
