{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 11:09:22 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase2] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Phase 2 implementation starting - Path Resolution and Import Type Detection. Reviewed Phase 1 completion (97% grade, all 18 tests passing). Understanding architecture: Phase 2 adds _resolve_import_path() and _find_workspace_root() helpers to categorize imports as stdlib/third_party/local/unresolved and resolve local imports to actual file paths. Will implement tasks 2A\u21922B\u21922C\u21922D\u21922E sequentially. | phase=2; reasoning={\"how\": \"Sequential implementation: 2A (path resolver core), 2B (workspace root detection), 2C (response schema integration), 2D (readable formatter), 2E (test suite)\", \"what\": \"Phase 1 extracts imports via AST but doesn't resolve them. Phase 2 adds stdlib detection, workspace root finding, and path resolution for local imports\", \"why\": \"Need to categorize imports by type and resolve local imports to enable governance (detecting forbidden imports, orphaned modules, dependency graphs)\"}; task=initialization; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:09:22.924786+00:00_2510a257", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:09:22.924816+00:00"}
