{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 11:09:40 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase2] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Starting Task 2A: Path Resolver Core. Will create _resolve_import_path() function to detect import types (stdlib, third_party, local, unresolved) and resolve local imports to file paths. Key decisions: use sys.stdlib_module_names for stdlib detection (Python 3.10+), attempt path resolution for local imports, return type + resolved_path + exists metadata. | phase=2; reasoning={\"how\": \"Use sys.stdlib_module_names set for stdlib detection, attempt path construction from workspace root for local imports, check file existence\", \"what\": \"Creating resolver that distinguishes stdlib (os, sys), third_party (requests), local (scribe_mcp.*), and unresolved imports\", \"why\": \"Need to categorize imports to enable governance checks and dependency analysis\"}; task=2A_start; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:09:40.912588+00:00_1573cec4", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:09:40.912616+00:00"}
