{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 11:11:18 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase2] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Implemented _find_workspace_root() and _resolve_import_path() functions in tools/read_file.py. Workspace root finder searches upward for .git/, pyproject.toml, setup.py, package.json with caching (max 10 levels). Path resolver detects stdlib via sys.stdlib_module_names, resolves relative imports (level>0) by navigating up directories, resolves absolute imports from workspace root, and categorizes as stdlib/third_party/local/unresolved with exists status. | files_changed=[\"tools/read_file.py\"]; lines_added=230; phase=2; reasoning={\"how\": \"Workspace root uses upward directory traversal with marker detection. Import resolver uses sys.stdlib_module_names for stdlib, path construction for local, and categorizes remaining as third_party or unresolved\", \"what\": \"Two core functions: workspace root detection with caching, and import resolution with type categorization\", \"why\": \"Need helper functions before integrating with _extract_imports()\"}; task=2A_2B_implementation; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:11:18.232505+00:00_314921ac", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:11:18.232533+00:00"}
