{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 11:15:33 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase2] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Task 2D complete - updated readable formatter in utils/response.py to display resolution status. Dependencies now grouped by type (stdlib, third_party, local, unresolved) with visual indicators: [stdlib]/[third-party] tags, checkmark for existing local files, X for missing local files, resolved paths shown indented. Fallback to Phase 1 display if no resolution data present (backward compatible). Display limit 10 per type for clean output. | files_changed=[\"utils/response.py\"]; lines_changed=140; phase=2; reasoning={\"how\": \"Check for import_type field presence, group with defaultdict, iterate type_order, format based on import_type and exists status, fallback to Phase 1 if no resolution\", \"what\": \"Enhanced dependency formatter to group by type, show resolution paths, and use visual indicators (checkmarks, X, tags)\", \"why\": \"Clear visual representation of import resolution helps users understand dependencies and identify issues (missing imports, forbidden dependencies)\"}; task=2D_complete; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:15:33.698389+00:00_44b0e072", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:15:33.698420+00:00"}
