{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 11:15:43 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase2] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Starting Task 2E: Create comprehensive test suite for Phase 2 resolution. Need to test: (1) _find_workspace_root() - marker detection, caching, max levels, (2) _resolve_import_path() - stdlib detection, third_party categorization, local resolution for absolute and relative imports, exists status, (3) Integration - resolution metadata in imports list, unresolved list population, (4) Performance - ensure resolution overhead stays <20% | phase=2; reasoning={\"how\": \"Create test file with fixtures for different import scenarios, verify resolution types and paths match expectations, measure overhead\", \"what\": \"Test workspace root detection, stdlib/third_party/local categorization, path resolution for relative imports, missing file detection, performance overhead\", \"why\": \"Comprehensive testing ensures resolution logic works correctly and prevents regressions\"}; task=2E_start; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:15:43.587885+00:00_529792ee", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:15:43.587923+00:00"}
