{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 11:44:10 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase3] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Starting Task 3A: Repository Scanner. Will create _scan_repository_imports() function to discover all Python files in repo and extract their imports. Target location: after _resolve_import_path() function around line 613. Will use .rglob('*.py') for discovery, exclude common dirs (.git, __pycache__, .venv, node_modules), handle syntax errors gracefully, implement max_files limit (500), add progress tracking every 50 files. Performance target: <3 seconds for scribe_mcp repo. | estimated_time=45min; function=_scan_repository_imports; risk=MEDIUM; task=3A; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:44:10.972946+00:00_083265e3", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:44:10.972972+00:00"}
