{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 11:45:09 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase3] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Task 3A COMPLETE: Repository Scanner implemented. Added _scan_repository_imports() function (112 lines) at line 615. Features: recursive .py file discovery with .rglob(), excludes 9 common dirs (.git, __pycache__, .venv, etc), handles syntax/encoding/generic errors gracefully (skip with warning), max_files limit (500), progress logging every 50 files. Returns Dict[str, List[str]] mapping repo-relative paths to imported module names. Defensive programming: catches all exceptions, returns partial results on failure. | file=tools/read_file.py; function=_scan_repository_imports; lines_added=112; task=3A; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:45:09.531164+00:00_477067f7", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:45:09.531194+00:00"}
