{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 11:45:21 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase3] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Starting Task 3B: Reverse Index Builder (HIGH RISK - core complexity of Phase 3). Will create _build_reverse_index() to invert forward index: for each file's imports, record the importing file. Key challenges: (1) Map module names to file paths using Phase 2's _resolve_import_path(), (2) Normalize paths to repo-relative, (3) Handle unresolvable imports gracefully (skip, don't crash), (4) Deduplicate importer lists. Returns Dict[str, List[str]] mapping {imported_file_path: [files_that_import_it]}. Must be defensive - this is where complexity lives. | estimated_time=60min; function=_build_reverse_index; reasoning={\"how\": \"Iterate forward index, resolve each import to file path, build reverse mapping with dedup\", \"what\": \"Core algorithm: invert forward index using import resolution from Phase 2\", \"why\": \"Enable impact analysis by answering 'what imports this file?'\"}; risk=HIGH; task=3B; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:45:21.650693+00:00_117a5ed3", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:45:21.650726+00:00"}
