{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 11:46:04 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase3] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Task 3B COMPLETE: Reverse Index Builder implemented (99 lines). Added _build_reverse_index() at line 727. Core algorithm: iterates forward_index, resolves each import to file path via Phase 2's _resolve_import_path(), builds reverse mapping {imported_file: [importers]}. Key features: only processes local imports (skips stdlib/third_party), normalizes paths to repo-relative, deduplicates importer lists, tracks resolution stats (resolved vs unresolved counts), defensive error handling (skip failed resolutions, continue). This is the HIGH RISK task - complexity managed through clear algorithm steps and extensive logging. | file=tools/read_file.py; function=_build_reverse_index; lines_added=99; reasoning={\"how\": \"Iterate all imports, resolve each to path, build reverse dict with dedup and normalization\", \"what\": \"Use Phase 2 resolution to map module names to file paths, handle unresolvable imports gracefully\", \"why\": \"Invert forward index to enable impact analysis\"}; risk=HIGH; task=3B; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T11:46:04.299875+00:00_25231275", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T11:46:04.299903+00:00"}
