{"op": "append", "content": "[\u274c] [2026-01-07 12:03:29 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: read_file_enhancement] CRITICAL BUG CONFIRMED: Reverse index missing internal imports due to namespace resolution issue. When resolving scribe_mcp.storage.base: workspace_root=/scribe_mcp/, tries to find scribe_mcp/scribe_mcp/storage/base.py (wrong) instead of scribe_mcp/storage/base.py (correct). Module name includes top-level package but workspace root is already in that directory. Impact: Phase 3 blast radius severely undercounted - only shows relative imports, missing ALL absolute internal imports. Fixing now in _resolve_import_path(). | bug_type=namespace_resolution; fix_location=_resolve_import_path; impact=blast_radius_undercount; phase=phase_3_bug_fix; reasoning={\"how\": \"Strip top-level package name when it matches workspace directory name\", \"what\": \"scribe_mcp.storage.base resolves to scribe_mcp/scribe_mcp/storage/base.py instead of storage/base.py\", \"why\": \"Absolute imports include package name but workspace root already in package dir\"}; root_cause=double_package_name_in_path; severity=critical; priority=high; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T12:03:29.076012+00:00_4d43a0e2", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T12:03:29.076040+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-01-07T12:03:29.076012+00:00_4d43a0e2", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T12:03:29.086517+00:00"}
{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 12:04:46 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: read_file_enhancement] CRITICAL BUG FIXED! Namespace resolution issue resolved in _resolve_import_path(). Added workspace package name stripping logic: when module name starts with workspace directory name (e.g., scribe_mcp.storage.base with workspace=scribe_mcp/), strips prefix to get storage.base \u2192 storage/base.py. Added regression test test_workspace_package_name_stripping(). All 50 tests passing (49 original + 1 new). Fix ready for live testing post-MCP reboot. | bug_fixed=namespace_resolution; fix_details=workspace_package_name_stripping; lines_changed=12; phase=phase_3_bug_fix_complete; reasoning={\"how\": \"Check if module_name.startswith(workspace_root.name + '.') then strip that prefix before path conversion\", \"what\": \"Added prefix stripping when module name starts with workspace name\", \"why\": \"Absolute imports included package name but workspace root already in package directory\"}; test_status=all_passing; tests_added=1; total_tests=50; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T12:04:46.679055+00:00_7f43dfd9", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T12:04:46.679081+00:00"}
