{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 12:16:33 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase4] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Task 4B COMPLETE! Added 3 functions to tools/read_file.py (180 lines): (1) _load_boundary_rules() - loads YAML config with global caching, checks enabled flag, returns None if missing/disabled. (2) _validate_boundary_rules() - validates required fields, severity values (error;warning;info), pattern structure. (3) _match_rule_pattern() - glob pattern matching with ** support via regex conversion, handles absolute/relative paths. Also added json+logging imports. Ready for Task 4C: violation checker. | functions=3; lines_added=180; phase=4_part2_boundary; reasoning={\"how\": \"Global cache for rules (path-aware invalidation), comprehensive validation with logging warnings, regex-based ** pattern matching\", \"what\": \"Loader with caching, validator with schema checks, pattern matcher with ** glob support\", \"why\": \"Need efficient rule loading with validation and pattern matching for boundary enforcement\"}; task=4B_complete; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T12:16:33.761821+00:00_af11df02", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T12:16:33.761853+00:00"}
