{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-07 12:18:04 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-Phase4] [Project: read_file_enhancement] Task 4D COMPLETE! Integrated boundary checking into read_file response schema (lines 1754-1787). When include_dependencies=True, automatically loads boundary rules, checks violations, adds boundary_violations key with: enabled (bool), violations (list), total_violations (int), has_errors (bool). Graceful degradation: if rules missing/disabled returns {enabled: false}, if error logs warning and returns {enabled: false, error}. Ready for Task 4E: readable formatter display. | lines_added=34; phase=4_part2_boundary; reasoning={\"how\": \"Load rules, check violations, add to response with graceful error handling (no scan failure if boundary check fails)\", \"what\": \"Added boundary_violations key to response dict with enabled flag, violations list, error count, and has_errors flag\", \"why\": \"Need boundary violations in response for both structured and readable output\"}; task=4D_complete; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/read_file_enhancement/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T12:18:04.900879+00:00_4003d2cb", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T12:18:04.900907+00:00"}
